<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-2103] Unnecessary request to Helium registry</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2103</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Every &lt;tt&gt;Helium.getAllPackageInfo()&lt;/tt&gt; call read helium package information from all registry configured (both local registry, online registry by default).&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Problem is, &lt;tt&gt;Helium.getAllPackageInfo()&lt;/tt&gt; is used inside of many other methods. like &lt;tt&gt;Helium.suggestApp()&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;Helium.enable()&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;Helium.disable()&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;Helium.recreateBundle()&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;Helium.getPackageInfo()&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So local/remote registry is unnecessarily accessed more than it should do.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13042542">ZEPPELIN-2103</key>
